@startuml
left to right direction

title Use Case Diagram for AI-Powered Analysis & Insights System

rectangle "System" {
  usecase "CFR001: View Financial Insights Dashboard" as CFR001
  usecase "SAFR001: Manage Analysis Parameters" as SAFR001
  usecase "FAFR002: View Client Intervention Alerts" as FAFR002
  usecase "CFR003: View Financial Predictions" as CFR003
  usecase "CFR004: Receive Personalized Recommendations" as CFR004
  usecase "CFR005: Manage Recommendation Preferences" as CFR005
  usecase "CFR006: View Spending Limit Alerts" as CFR006
  usecase "CFR007: View Investment Opportunities" as CFR007
  usecase "CFR008: Access News Related to Portfolio" as CFR008
  usecase "CFR009: Manage Relationship with Financial Advisors" as CFR009
  usecase "FAFR001: Manage Client Mentoring Sessions" as FAFR001
  usecase "SFR002: Deliver Personalized Recommendations" as SFR002
  usecase "SFR003: Request Financial Predictions" as SFR003
  usecase "AIFR001: Generate Financial Predictions" as AIFR001
  usecase "CFR011: Send Feedback to System" as CFR011

  Client --> CFR001 : View dashboard\nwith financial data\nand insights.
  SysAdmin --> SAFR001 : Manage analysis parameters.\nEnsures accuracy and compliance with regulations like Basel III.

  User -> (Client) : Represents any user role including clients, advisors, or system admins. Can navigate through the system's features.

  Client --|> CFR003 : View financial predictions\nbased on historical data and market trends.
  SysAdmin --> SAFR001 : Manage analysis parameters.\nAdjusts settings for AI algorithms to stay compliant with regulations like Basel III.

  Client -> SFR002 : Receive personalized recommendations aligned\nto their financial profile and goals. 

  Client --|> CFR004 : Get tailored investment advice\nbased on risk tolerance and market conditions.
  
  SysAdmin --> AIFR001 : Generate predictions using historical data,\nmarket trends, and economic indicators.\nEnsures compliance with industry standards.

  Client -> SFR003 : Request financial predictions from the AI component. 

  User --|> CFR005 : Adjust preferences for recommendations\nto align with personal goals and risk tolerance.
  
  SysAdmin --> AIFR002 : Generate spending limit alerts\nwhen user exceeds defined thresholds.\nHelps maintain budget control.

  Client -> SFR004 : Request personalized recommendations from the AI component. 

  User --|> CFR006 : View alerts when exceeding expense limits\nto manage personal finances effectively.
  
  SysAdmin --> AIFR003 : Generate spending limit alerts\nbased on user's transaction history.\nComplies with financial regulations.

  Client -> SFR005 : Request spending limit alerts from the AI component. 

  User --|> CFR007 : Discover investment opportunities suitable\nto their risk profile, as per MiFID II or equivalent.
  
  SysAdmin --> AIFR004 : Configure analysis parameters\nfor specific client segments.\nCustomizes system behavior based on different profiles and regulations.

  Client -> SFR006 : Request investment opportunity analyses from the AI component. 

  User --|> CFR008 : Stay informed about market events affecting their portfolio.\nAccess relevant financial news.
  
  SysAdmin --> AIFR007 : Generate contextualized news insights\nby correlating user portfolios with financial headlines.

  Client -> SFR007 : Request investment opportunities matching\ncriteria and ESG preferences. 

  User --|> CFR009 : Access a consolidated view of all financial information.\nEfficiently monitor finances in one place.
  
  SysAdmin --> AIFR008 : Generate client predictive intervention recommendations\nwhen patterns suggest potential issues or opportunities.

  Client -> SFR013 : Request generation of alerts based on predefined conditions. 

  User --|> CFR010 : Manage sharing and privacy settings for financial data.\nControl who can access their information.
  
  SysAdmin --> AIFR009 : Generate client predictive insights\nfor forward-looking analysis, enhancing advisory value.

  Client -> SFR014 : Request generation of analytics to understand\nfinancial behavior trends. 

  User --|> FAFR002 : View alerts from the system\ndetecting patterns requiring professional attention.\nProactively assist clients with financial issues.
  
  SysAdmin --> AIFR005 : Generate investment opportunities aligned\nwith user's risk profile and portfolio goals.

  Client -> SFR017 : Request generation of comprehensive reports\nassessing overall financial health. 

  User --|> FAFR003: View predictive analytics about clients' situations.\nSupport data-driven recommendations during consultations.
  
  SysAdmin --> AIFR006 : Generate anomaly transaction alerts\nto comply with anti-money laundering regulations.

  Client -> SFR018 : Track progress towards financial goals\nand receive relevant updates. 

  User --|> FAFR004: View analysis parameters for specific segments.\nCustomize system behavior based on client profiles and standards like GDPR or CCPA.
  
  SysAdmin --> AIFR002: Generate spending limit alerts\nto ensure adherence to defined thresholds.

  Client -> SFR19 : Maintain historical records of insights\nfor trend analysis. 

  User --|> FAFR005: View client dashboards in an intuitive format.\nMonitor finances easily.
  
  SysAdmin --> AIFR010: Generate financial health reports\ncalculated using standard ratios and metrics.

  Client -> SFR20 : Provide feedback to the system\nimproving future outputs. 

}

@enduml